    "Nilotinib has conflicting predicted low bioavailability values (16–25%, <25%) versus the strongest absolute fasted-human record of 31%; the predicted low values are less direct but introduce some uncertainty.",
    "Some evidence is qualitative or derived from predicted models or special formulations rather than direct absolute measurements in ordinary conditions."
  ],
